					<element type="Background Feature" name="Variant Feature" requiredLevel="1" checksum="a4ab18f2" registered="" />
					<element type="List" name="Personality Trait" requiredLevel="1" number="1" checksum="70eebf7e" isList="true" registered="1">I always have a plan for what to do when things go wrong.</element>
					<element type="List" name="Personality Trait" requiredLevel="1" number="2" checksum="e9e7eec4" isList="true" registered="5">I am incredibly slow to trust. Those who seem the fairest often have the most to hide.</element>
					<element type="List" name="Ideal" requiredLevel="1" checksum="ef6f1515" isList="true" registered="5">People. I’m loyal to my friends, not to any ideals, and everyone else can take a trip down the Styx for all I care. (Neutral)</element>
					<element type="List" name="Bond" requiredLevel="1" checksum="79e0a6f3" isList="true" registered="5">I’m guilty of a terrible crime. I hope I can redeem myself for it.</element>
					<element type="List" name="Flaw" requiredLevel="1" checksum="c690aeb3" isList="true" registered="5">I turn tail and run when things look bad.</element>
					<element type="Background Feature" name="Feature: Ear to the Ground" id="ID_SCAG_BACKGROUND_FEATURE_URBAN_BOUNTY_HUNTER_EARTOTHEGROUND" />
				</element>
